  "cited_article_id": "generate-and-submit-claims",
  "reply": "To clear validation errors, go to **Billing > Claim Center**, open the **Validation Queue** tab, and click each flagged claim. In the editor, correct the highlighted issues (e.g., missing modifiers, invalid IDs) and then click **Save & Re‑validate**. Once all claims validate without the red error icon, you can select them and choose **Batch & Submit**. If errors persist despite correct data, verify the payer’s format requirements under **Billing > Payer Rules**."
}
